Package: numa
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: aarch64_cortex-a53
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: numa-openwrt
Description: Portable DNS resolver (upstream numa), static musl build.
 Built from @UPSTREAM_TAG@ (@UPSTREAM_COMMIT@) with @VARIANT@ CPU tuning.
 Upstream links mimalloc on musl targets. Installs the binary and a procd
 service. The config is generated on the router with `numa-ctl gen-config`;
 nothing is started on install.
